{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truco Bar is a unique digital experience that brings the lively atmosphere of classic Brazilian &quot;botecos&quot; (local bars) into the world of gaming. Inspired by Brazilian popular culture, this Truco Paulista card game lets you play matches with 2 or 4 players, whether with friends or strangers online. <br><br>Sit at the table, crack open an imaginary cold one, and get ready to shout \u201cTRUCO!\u201d in the heat of the moment. Bluff, raise the stakes, call six, nine, or twelve and don\u2019t forget the iconic \u201c\u00e9 o zap!\u201d. But it\u2019s not just about the cards the laid back environment, bar inspired soundtrack, and in-game chat turn every match into a true hangout. <br><br>Truco Bar is more than just a card game, it\u2019s a tribute to street smarts, friendship, and the good old chaos of a bar table. Whether you're a bluffing pro or a curious newcomer, the table\u2019s set. All that's missing is you.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355590?t=1760040201","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3355590?t=1760040201","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355590/1d13deb5410ff4735992dc2fe45efe2b94719c5f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1760040201","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355590/1d13deb5410ff4735992dc2fe45efe2b94719c5f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1760040201","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"In the scene there are some bottles of alcoholic drinks and cigarettes."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Truco Bar is a unique digital experience that brings the lively atmosphere of classic Brazilian &quot;botecos&quot; (local bars) into the world of gaming. Inspired by Brazilian popular culture, this Truco Paulista card game lets you play matches with 2 or 4 players, whether with friends or strangers online. <br><br>Sit at the table, crack open an imaginary cold one, and get ready to shout \u201cTRUCO!\u201d in the heat of the moment. Bluff, raise the stakes, call six, nine, or twelve and don\u2019t forget the iconic \u201c\u00e9 o zap!\u201d. But it\u2019s not just about the cards the laid back environment, bar inspired soundtrack, and in-game chat turn every match into a true hangout. <br><br>Truco Bar is more than just a card game, it\u2019s a tribute to street smarts, friendship, and the good old chaos of a bar table. Whether you're a bluffing pro or a curious newcomer, the table\u2019s set. All that's missing is you.</p>","developers":["LoboAnarquista","Jo\u00e3o Rafael Refatti Silva"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3355590/675acfcc4440e233b79a7937861e178ca8e00e57/header.jpg?t=1760040201","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3355590/1932304438/1219069d6cb85403c8ecef43a2dc8e97f3a34a69/1755397245/dash_av1.mpd?t=1755710388","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3355590/1932304438/1219069d6cb85403c8ecef43a2dc8e97f3a34a69/1755397245/dash_h264.mpd?t=1755710388","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_t